{size200}{grey}{bold1}Tactical {red}Update {grey}- May 1st, 2006{bold0}
{size0}{black}- 2.Ej version fixes some bugs with on-line game connection interface.

{size200}{grey}{bold1}Tactical {purple}Easter Eggs {grey}- Apr 17th, 2006{bold0}
{size0}{black}- Play hide and seek in {blueink}MatMap by Matlabass{black} designed like a garden 'à la Française'. Who will break the ice first in this solid winter game level {blueink}Snowy Islands by Stubert{black}. Solve your neighbourhood problems with tanks in the add-on {blueink}Interlock by Tyler{black}.

{size200}{grey}{bold1}Tactical {red}Update {grey}- Apr 15th, 2006{bold0}
